1
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,520
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,400
=Episode 14=

3
00:00:53,719 --> 00:00:54,920
My Demon Core

4
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,840
can serve as a vessel for the Stone.

5
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,479
But you will need the Twin Hands

6
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:03,320
to extract the Stone
from her and replace it.

7
00:01:04,079 --> 00:01:05,920
Then you can use the Stone
to mend the sky.

8
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:10,359
And the Core will keep your alive.

9
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,920
Thank you, Elder.

10
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:15,560
But what are the Twin Hands?

11
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:18,640
The Twin Hands are a forbidden art

12
00:01:18,879 --> 00:01:20,799
that harnesses the power of creation.

13
00:01:21,159 --> 00:01:23,280
And the one who wields the Twin Hands

14
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,840
is none other than your Huanxi Kingdom's

15
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,680
Queen Zhang.

16
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,599
Little demoness.

17
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,000
Young Taoist.

18
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,879
This path is fraught with danger.

19
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:36,519
And once the Stone is removed
from her body,

20
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:38,319
she will lose

21
00:01:38,879 --> 00:01:40,879
everything about you.

22
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:49,680
If love ends in forgetting...

23
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:54,200
Then love without reservation
to the very end.

24
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:04,920
Right now,

25
00:02:05,239 --> 00:02:06,680
the person you want to see

26
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,879
should be able to see you too.

27
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,800
Master has sealed the barrier
completely.

28
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,560
It looks like
he's keeping something out.

29
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,400
Since your master sealed it himself,

30
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:54,240
that means he must be safe for now.

31
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:58,680
Senior and Chi Xiao
are still dealing with Xuanwu Sect

32
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,879
and looking into the Twin Hands.

33
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,759
What do we do now?

34
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,800
I know a place we can stay for now.

35
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:06,439
Hmm.

36
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,319
Yuanchu,

37
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:12,199
I've missed you so much!

38
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:13,319
My boy!

39
00:03:13,319 --> 00:03:14,120
Eat up!

40
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,520
Your father's cooking

41
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,520
could rival any fine restaurant

42
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,280
in the city.

43
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,919
You won't find better anywhere.

44
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:24,639
Oh, and

45
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,919
who is this young lady?

46
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,280
Father,

47
00:03:31,479 --> 00:03:32,439
she is my wife.

48
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,599
You lucky boy!

49
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,759
You chose well.

50
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:45,159
My dear daughter‑in‑law, come, come!

51
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,479
It's our first meeting.

52
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,639
I didn't have time to prepare.

53
00:03:47,759 --> 00:03:48,560
Here, here.

54
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:53,560
Here is a little something for you.

55
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,479
So many treasures!

56
00:03:55,479 --> 00:03:56,280
Take them.

57
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,319
A welcoming gift!

58
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,199
You are too kind.

59
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,479
Thank you.

60
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,960
Here.

61
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:07,919
And this too.

62
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,000
Take it.

63
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,000
I really shouldn't...

64
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,120
Do not worry about it.

65
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,480
Thank you.

66
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,040
Look at you,

67
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:22,839
acting so formal with your own father!

68
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:23,959
Not really.

69
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:26,399
I never had a son of my own.

70
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:28,519
I took a liking to Yuanchu,

71
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:31,040
and I'm close with his master.

72
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,720
So I decided to become his godfather.

73
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:34,519
By the way,

74
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,519
my dear daughter‑in‑law,

75
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,279
when will I

76
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:41,000
become a grandfather?

77
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,560
That's not up to me alone.

78
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,519
You'll have to ask him.

79
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,319
You decide.

80
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:50,800
You decide.

81
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,439
Great!

82
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,519
I am overjoyed today!

83
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:56,319
I will arrange your wedding right away.

84
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:59,360
I will invite every noble and official
in the capital.

85
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:01,279
Everything in the Lu family

86
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:02,759
will be yours.

87
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:03,839
Really?

88
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:04,639
Of course!

89
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:06,439
You are too generous.

90
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,600
You're so kind.

91
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:08,879
It is only right.

92
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:10,079
It's nothing.

93
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,399
Father,

94
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:14,720
have you seen my Senior lately?

95
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:16,439
No, I haven't.

96
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:19,879
I haven't even seen your master
for days.

97
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:22,439
Has something happened?

98
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,279
Nothing.

99
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,240
Some old friends
are visiting the capital.

100
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:30,040
Master is in seclusion today.

101
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:30,879
He's not receiving visitors.

102
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,800
I see.

103
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,759
Don't worry.
Stay here as long as you like.

104
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:37,360
When your friends arrive,

105
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:39,519
I'll host them properly.

106
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,519
Thank you.

107
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:43,279
You are welcome.

108
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,160
Now, let's eat.

109
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,439
Yeah.

110
00:05:46,439 --> 00:05:48,519
Do I look pretty?

111
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,279
You do.

112
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:51,920
Eat up.

113
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,040
Yeah.

114
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:53,879
Eat up.

115
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:54,839
Have some vegetables.

116
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:56,560
You have some too. I don't like them.

117
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,800
I envy you.

118
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:02,399
Even though you were an orphan,

119
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:04,279
you have always had your Master,

120
00:06:04,279 --> 00:06:06,839
your Senior, and Godfather
caring for you.

121
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,480
Now they're your family too.

122
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:17,279
We'll all protect you
and take care of you.

123
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,920
Hmm.

124
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:22,879
Do you have any wishes for the future?

125
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:25,439
A wish?

126
00:06:27,079 --> 00:06:28,399
I cannot tell you.

127
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:31,680
In the mortal world,

128
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,319
a wish will not come true
if you say it out loud.

129
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,519
But in the Demon Realm,

130
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,680
you have to shout your wish

131
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,560
at the heavens for it to be heard.

132
00:06:41,959 --> 00:06:43,639
Better kept in the heart.

133
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:45,160
A sincere heart makes it come true.

134
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,959
Keeping secrets, are you?

135
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:49,920
Fine.

136
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,279
Wow!

137
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:09,120
(Even if you forget me in the end,)

138
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:11,839
(I will always stay by your side.)

139
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,560
Ah!

140
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,519
Father.

141
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,680
I will find the killer

142
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,959
and avenge you.

143
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:54,680
His body was severed.

144
00:07:55,879 --> 00:07:57,759
Who could be so heartless?

145
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:02,839
It's not just one Bloodskin.

146
00:08:05,439 --> 00:08:07,519
The capital is guarded
by the Demon Hunting Bureau

147
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:10,759
and countless Hunters.

148
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,519
If it were a demon,

149
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,839
how could it kill so often
without being caught?

150
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:17,759
Let's examine the body first.

151
00:08:30,439 --> 00:08:32,440
All the flesh and bone is gone.

152
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,399
Only the skin remains intact.

153
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,159
If it was not a demon,

154
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,080
could a human do this?

155
00:08:39,279 --> 00:08:42,039
I've heard of heretics who use dark arts

156
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,000
to boost their power.

157
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:47,720
But why kill my godfather?

158
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:50,759
Don't be too hard on yourself.

159
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,840
Whether human or demon,

160
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:59,320
we've somehow
become the prime suspects.

161
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,799
All we can do is catch the real killer

162
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:02,840
and clear our names.

163
00:09:09,679 --> 00:09:10,840
I will help you.

164
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:12,200
Ah!

165
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:30,679
Are you

166
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,720
human or ghost?

167
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,440
The coroner of this office is my master.

168
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:38,559
My name is Lin Shuangyue.

169
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,519
When did you get here?

170
00:09:54,919 --> 00:09:58,519
Since the moment
you started examining the body.

171
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,600
So you heard everything

172
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,679
we said just now?

173
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:06,320
I also know you're being hunted.

174
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,360
(Wanted)

175
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,000
You are not the killers.

176
00:10:19,159 --> 00:10:20,399
How do you know?

177
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,480
If you were the killers,

178
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,960
you would have killed me

179
00:10:25,039 --> 00:10:26,200
the moment I made a sound.

180
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,960
I'll get you inside information.

181
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:32,960
You catch the killer.

182
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:35,240
We solve this case together.

183
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:36,960
That way,

184
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,360
you clear your names,

185
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,960
and I get the reward.

186
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:45,639
That is a good deal.

187
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:50,480
So you're a money lover too.

188
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:53,399
Looking forward to it.

189
00:10:53,399 --> 00:10:54,240
Partner.

190
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:03,960
(Jichun Healing Hall)

191
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,879
I heard the official killed today

192
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,600
was a good one. He spoke for the people.

193
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,279
But I wonder

194
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:11,200
why he ended up as a Bloodskin too.

195
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,919
A demon is haunting the city.

196
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:14,879
The people are terrified.

197
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:16,840
We need to catch the killer fast.

198
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,559
But this one is too clever.

199
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,679
We have no leads at all.

200
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:27,120
Doctor Lin,

201
00:11:27,559 --> 00:11:29,279
we have too many patients.

202
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,000
And we still need to
distribute the demon-repelling porridge.

203
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,120
We're shorthanded.

204
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,360
We need more people.

205
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,440
(Still missing two herbs...)

206
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:37,840
(And a bit more of that...)

207
00:11:38,639 --> 00:11:40,159
We've got help right here.

208
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:45,840
(Just wait a moment more...)

209
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,960
This is perfect
for hiding your identities.

210
00:11:52,279 --> 00:11:54,720
Great. We've been tricked

211
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,519
into free labor.

212
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,720
Some partner you've got there.

213
00:12:01,639 --> 00:12:02,440
You...

214
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:07,840
(Jichun Healing Hall)

215
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:27,640
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

216
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:31,040
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

217
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:34,560
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

218
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:37,880
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

219
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:44,800
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

220
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:52,395
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

221
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:56,640
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

222
00:12:56,640 --> 00:13:00,480
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

223
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:07,280
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
